# Example only. MUST NOT be installed by setup-vps.sh or
# bootstrap-control-plane.sh. Default runtime remains host binaries.
#
# After app images are production runtime, copy this file to
# /etc/systemd/system/radon-.service.d/runtime-container.conf and replace
# IMAGE with the unit command. Empty ExecStart= clears the host binary.
# Host network does not share the host mount namespace: bind-mount
# NOTIFY_SOCKET so Type=notify WatchdogSec still sees WATCHDOG=1.
# Do not mount the Docker engine socket. Do not pull at start if the image is absent;
# GHCR down must not block RADON_RUNTIME=host (the live units).
#
# [Service]
# Environment=RADON_RUNTIME=container
# ExecStart=
# ExecStart=docker run --network host --env-file /etc/radon/env --env NOTIFY_SOCKET --env WATCHDOG_USEC --mount type=bind,src=${NOTIFY_SOCKET},dst=${NOTIFY_SOCKET} --rm --name %N IMAGE
